    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. but if someone actually brings up the specific criticism that ESG isn't just \"progressive\" but is actually a form of \"woke capitalism\" that prioritizes political agendas over economic reality, what's the most effective way to respond? I want to make sure we don't just ignore the criticism but instead show why that viewpoint is fundamentally flawed or based on a misunderstanding of modern finance.",
